:''For the enemies, see [[Crazed Gross Cat (Enemy)]] or [[Manic Macho Legs (Enemy)]].''
'''Crazed Gross Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked once clearing the event stage [[Festival Gross (Insane)|The Crazed Gross]]. Its stage appears on the '''12th''' and '''26th''' of every month. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases health and Wave level. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], it is obtainable from rolling the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] after clearing Cosmic Club on the Interstellar Invasion chapter. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], its event and awakening stages are available every '''Tuesday'''.

